OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785412110
OL,3,CSadiq Khan appalled by ITV News
OL,4,CLondon's findings on bus driver welfare
OL,6,FAn ITV News London Freedom of
OL,7,FInformation investigation has found
OL,8,Fthat toilet provision across the
OL,9,Fcapital's bus network is worse than
OL,10,Fmany passengers might expect, with
OL,11,Fsome routes lacking facilities at
OL,12,Feither end of the journey and others
OL,13,Frelying on a single toilet despite
OL,14,Flengthy round-trip times. Drivers have
OL,15,Ftold us that driving routes in the
OL,16,Fearly hours and late at night often
OL,17,Fmean they don't have access to a
OL,18,Ftoilet at all.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785412110
OL,3,CSadiq Khan appalled by ITV News
OL,4,CLondon's findings on bus driver welfare
OL,6,FTransport for London says bus drivers
OL,7,Fhave access to a toilet at at least
OL,8,Fone terminus on every route, and that
OL,9,Froutes with a toilet at only one end
OL,10,Fshould have a maximum round-trip time
OL,11,Fof 150 minutes.
OL,13,FThe Mayor of London told us that the
OL,14,Flack of toilet provision for London's
OL,15,Fbus drivers is unacceptable.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
