CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785412110
OL,3,CSadiq Khan appalled by ITV News
OL,4,CLondon's findings on bus driver welfare
OL,6,FA TfL spokesperson said: "We take
OL,7,Fdriver welfare seriously and it's
OL,8,Fvital that bus drivers are able to
OL,9,Faccess toilet facilities while
OL,10,Fworking. There is ongoing work on a
OL,11,Frange of measures to improve health
OL,12,Fand wellbeing for bus drivers, as well
OL,13,Fas providing safe and usable welfare
OL,14,Ffacilities for our staff to use during
OL,15,Ftheir breaks. In the past eight years,
OL,16,F154 locations have either been
OL,17,Frefurbished or had a brand new toilet
OL,18,Finstalled. The vast majority of routes
OL,19,Fhave suitable toilet facilities at
OL,20,Ftheir termini and we are determined to
OL,21,Fimprove provision where possible."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
