OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785412110
OL,3,CSadiq Khan appalled by ITV News
OL,4,CLondon's findings on bus driver welfare
OL,6,FThe recent heatwave in London has
OL,7,Fraised concerns about the working
OL,8,Fconditions of bus drivers,
OL,9,Fparticularly the lack of proper toilet
OL,10,Ffacilities and the heat inside bus
OL,11,Fcabs.
OL,13,FA motion to introduce a 'Bill of
OL,14,FRights' for bus drivers was
OL,15,Funanimously backed by the London
OL,16,FAssembly earlier this month.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
